<title>USA: Genesee &amp; Wyo Class A stake cut by investor.</title>
<headline>Genesee &amp; Wyo Class A stake cut by investor.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-07-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>New York-based investor Suzanne Fuller said Tuesday that she cut her stake in Genesee &amp; Wyoming Inc to 6.23 percent, or 273,941 of the company's Class A common shares.</p>
<p>In a U.S. Securities and Exchange Commission filing, Fuller reported the sale of 45,000 shares between July 8 and 23 at prices ranging from $25.80 to $26.17 a share.</p>
</text>
